firewall.inbound
  Drop incoming traffic that no rule allows
  Applies to this host.
  Arms the safety timer.

Why
  Without a firewall, any service listening on all addresses, such as a database
  left at its defaults, is reachable from the internet. This one accepts SSH,
  the ports the profile allows and replies to the server's own connections, and
  drops the rest.

Params (in the module's profile table)
  allow (default [])
      Ports to accept from anywhere, e.g. ["443/tcp", "443/udp"]; the SSH ports
      are always accepted.

Fixes these audit controls
  FW-001 [medium] Incoming traffic denied by default
